  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "78",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s78",
  "text": "If the registration of a trade mark is not renewed under section 77, then: (a) subject to sections 79 and 80, the registration ceases to have effect when it expires; and (b) unless the registration is renewed under section 79, the Registrar must remove the trade mark from the Register 6 months after the day on which the registration expired. Note: For month and Register see section 6.",
